{
  "_comment": [
    "Maps calendar events to the buckets published in the README time_split group.",
    "Rules are matched against the lowercased event summary, in order, first match wins.",
    "Event titles are NEVER published — only the aggregated hours per bucket.",
    "Tune the keyword lists once real titles are flowing; the defaults are a starting point."
